<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears Gant for public trade.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears Gant for public trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has cleared the 3.7 million shares in currency exchange firm Gant SA for public trade, including a 1.2-1.3-million- share public offering, the KPW said in a Thursday statement.</p>
<p>The firm seeks to start trade on the Warsaw bourse's third tier in November.</p>
<p>    Tranches	     No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period*</p>
<p>			     1,300,000		September 17-24</p>
<p> Lead Manager:	   Dom Maklerski BIG-BG Sp. z o.o. broker</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:	increase working capital and open new</p>
<p>			     outlets</p>
